Package: rk628-rpi-dkms
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends}, dkms, udev, linux-headers-rpi-v8, linux-headers-rpi-2712
Description: RK628 driver and overlays for 64-bit Raspberry Pi OS
 Out-of-tree RK628 video and HDMI receiver modules built by DKMS for
 installed kernels. Includes overlays for Raspberry Pi 4 and 5 and udev
 rules providing stable device names.
 .
 Overlay activation in the boot configuration remains a manual operation.
